//! | `deflateSync('hello')` | `789ccb48cdc9c90700062c0215` |
//! | `deflateRawSync('hello')` | `cb48cdc9c90700` |
//! | `gzipSync('hello')` | `1f8b08000000000000ffcb48cdc9c9070086a6103605000000` |
//! | `brotliCompressSync('')` | `3b` |
